id: TEST-028
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Unmocked Date/time in test files
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .tsx .jsx
  exclude_paths: vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: describe
patterns:
  - regex: new\s+Date\s*\(\s*\)
    message: "new Date() in test — non-deterministic, causes flaky tests. Use fake timers or inject a clock."
  - regex: Date\.now\s*\(\s*\)
    message: "Date.now() in test — non-deterministic. Use jest.useFakeTimers() or sinon.useFakeTimers()."
fix: Use jest.useFakeTimers(), sinon.useFakeTimers(), or inject a clock interface for deterministic tests.
